                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">Thanks to <a href="https://github.com/jrhizor">@jrhizor</a> and <a href="https://github.com/cgardens">@cgardens</a>, we now support CDC for Postgres. This is a first step, as we will start supporting for other databases this month: MySQL, MSSQL, etc. </div>
