                      <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/airbyte-acquires-grouparoo-to-accelerate-data-movement">
