                      </td>
                      <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                        <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left: 25px;"><a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/airbyte-acquires-grouparoo-to-accelerate-data-movement" style="text-decoration: none;color:#010047;"><b>Airbyte acquires Grouparoo</b></a></div>
                        <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">Grouparoo, an open-source reverse-ELT product, joined the Airbyte team this week. We’ve brought on a team of reverse-ETL experts in-house, which is a huge step in our ability to accelerate data movement for our users! </div>
                        <a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/airbyte-acquires-grouparoo-to-accelerate-data-movement" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;padding-left: 25px;"><b>Read more here >> </b></span></a>

                      </td>
