                        <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">We launched Airbyte Cloud for anyone looking for the same extensible, data movement solution that Airbyte offers, without the resources or expertise required to manage an Airbyte open-source deployment.</div>
                        <a href="https://cloud.airbyte.io/signup" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;padding-left: 25px;"><b>Try Airbyte Cloud for free today >> </b></span></a>

