                        <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">We launched the Maintainer Program as a way to recognize the hard work of the community maintaining connectors. Join our waitlist and get compensated for helping to build new, or improve, connectors.</div>
