                            <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left: 25px;"><a href="https://docs.lakefs.io/integrations/airbyte.html" style="text-decoration: none;color:#010047;"><b>Using lakeFS with Airbyte</b></a></div>
                            <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">lakeFS is an open-source project that provides a git-like version control interface for data lakes. You can now use Airbyte to send data from any supported source to lakeFS using the S3 destination connector.</div>
