                            <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">Community member Bobby Iliev created a sample Github project that combines Airbyte PostgreSQL and Kafka connectors to stream data to Materialize. Materialize is a streaming database that maintains the results of a SQL query in memory as the data changes.</div>
