<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%"><span style="color: #1a194d;">In this article, Simon shows us the importance of Data Modeling in Data Engineering and why it is so crucial.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%; font-size:13px"><span style="color: #1a194d;"><a href="http://www.airbyte.io/?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" rel="noopener" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#615eff" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="PEip+xtf">Read more</a></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-spacing:0 !important; border-collapse:collapse; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt"><tbody><tr><td class="hs_padded" style="border-collapse:collapse; mso-line-height-rule:exactly; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#1a194d; word-break:break-word; padding:0px 40px 21px"><div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module-4-0-3" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module-4-0-3_" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><h2 style="margin:0; mso-line-height-rule:exactly; font-size:20px; line-height:125%; text-align:left" align="left"><span style="color: #1a194d;"><a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/snowflake-data-cloud?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#1a194d; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold" rel="noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="9m7br+6H">The Snowflake Effect: From Data Warehouse to Data Cloud</a></span></h2>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%"><span style="color: #1a194d;">Thalia gives us an amazing rundown on the history of Snowflake and how it has transitioned from a Data Warehouse to Data Cloud!</span></p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%; font-size:13px"><span style="color: #1a194d;"><a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/snowflake-data-cloud?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" rel="noopener" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#615eff" data-hs-link-id="1" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="ciXrwdZf">Read more</a></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
