<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-spacing:0 !important; border-collapse:collapse; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt"><tbody><tr><td class="hs_padded" style="border-collapse:collapse; mso-line-height-rule:exactly; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#1a194d; word-break:break-word; padding:0px 40px 21px"><div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module-10-0-1" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module-10-0-1_" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><div style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%; text-align:left; font-size:20px" align="left"><a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/dodging-data-extraction-errors?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#1a194d; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold" rel="noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="4x8/idcu">The Art of Abstraction in ETL: Dodging Data Extraction Errors</a></div>
<div style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:175%; text-align:left" align="left">
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; font-size:11px; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%">Emily Riederer talks about the challenges and pitfalls of data extraction in this blog post. Emily also offers some strategies for overcoming them! Definitely&nbsp;a must read.</p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; font-size:15px; line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; font-size:13px; line-height:125%"><span style="color: #1a194d;"><a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/dodging-data-extraction-errors?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" rel="noopener" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#615eff" data-hs-link-id="1" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="O1nY3s4E">Read more</a></span></p>
</div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-spacing:0 !important; border-collapse:collapse; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt"><tbody><tr><td class="hs_padded" style="border-collapse:collapse; mso-line-height-rule:exactly; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#1a194d; word-break:break-word; padding:0px 40px 25px"><div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module-10-0-2" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module-10-0-2_" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><div style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:125%; text-align:left; font-size:20px" align="left">
