<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:200%; font-size:15px"><span style="color: #fd694c;">• <span style="font-weight: bold;">Aritcle</span>: <a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/bigquery-optimize-queries?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#fd694c" rel="noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="SNGr1X1V">3 Techniques to Write Highly Optimized Queries For BigQuery</a> by: <a href="https://airbyte.com/blog-authors/kelvin-gakuo?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#fd694c" rel="noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="bICTlWaX">Kelvin Gakuo</a></span></p>
<p style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; line-height:200%; font-size:15px"><span style="color: #fd694c;">• <span style="font-weight: bold;">Aritcle</span>: <a href="https://airbyte.com/blog/amazon-s3-best-practices?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#fd694c" rel="noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="QjJ+WrOL">Amazon S3: Best Practices for Managing and Optimizing it</a> by: <a href="https://airbyte.com/blog-authors/faithful-adeda?utm_source=hs_email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz--LYHR09KSJmBLnHe0BIpmo4YBOz0Kc6HycTXxOtMuEefY0rTEkINIwRELWT8T75n-vBg_1" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; color:#fd694c" rel="noopener" data-hs-link-id="0" target="_blank" data-hs-link-id-v2="AKXY8M+7">Faithful Adeda</a></span></p>
