                        <td style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;"> <a href="https://airbyte.io/write-for-the-community"><img src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/605e01bc25f7e19a82e74788/6112463f5937a47c6fbea0f0_Newsletter_16_Write%20for%20the%20community.png" style="border: 0;display: block;outline: none;text-decoration: none;height: auto;width: 100%;font-size: 13px;border-radius: 8px;box-shadow: 1px 1px 1px 1px #DFDFDF;line-height: 100%;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;" width="520" alt="6112463f5937a47c6fbea0f0_Newsletter_16_Write%20for%20the%20community.png"></a>
                      </td>
