        </div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align: top;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;" width="100%">
            <tr>
              <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/write-for-the-community" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>Write for the community!</b></a>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;">We're interested in encouraging written contribution from the community and know that there is a lot of requested content yet to be made. Through this, you'll be able to get paid and receive recognition through writing content for us. </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 5px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <a href="https://airbyte.io/write-for-the-community" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;"><b>Check the program &gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      
      <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color: #EEEEF2;border-top: 1px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
