                <tr>
                  <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/contributors">
                    <img src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/605e01bc25f7e19a82e74788/6107c51391a9bace0c18539b_Contributor%20wall.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 200px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                    <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/contributors" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>All hail the Contributor page!</b></a>
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">In order to thank our contributors, we built a dedicated gamified page for them. They now have badges, levels, even monthly MVPs. We now also have dedicated swag packages! Contributing is becoming even more fun!</div>
                  <a href="https://airbyte.io/contributors" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;padding-left: 25px;"><b>Check the contributor page &gt;&gt; </b></span></a>
