                        <td style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;"> <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/architecture/incremental?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-06%20-20201216"><img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Incremental-v1_Append-only-v2.png" style="border: 0;display: block;outline: none;text-decoration: none;height: auto;width: 100%;font-size: 13px;border-radius: 8px;box-shadow: 1px 1px 1px 1px #DFDFDF;line-height: 100%;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;" width="520" alt="Incremental-v1_Append-only-v2.png"></a>
