        </div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align: top;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;" width="100%">
            <tr>
              <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;"><a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/architecture/incremental?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-06%20-20201216" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>We've released our 1st version of Incremental replication!</b></a>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;">Our append incremental sync is supported across all our destinations, and 10 source connectors (including Postgres, MySQL, Intercom, Zendesk, Stripe, Twilio, Marketo, Shopify, GitHub, etc). We will expand it to all sources in the coming weeks.</div>
            </td>
