                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">Thanks to <a href="https://github.com/marcosmarxm">@marcosmarxm</a>, Airbyte's integration with Airflow has been merged into Airflow's main code base. It will be released in Airflow's next release. You will be able to run Airbyte jobs from Airflow directly. This was the most requested feature in the last few months. </div>
