<div style="background:#FFFFFF;background-color:#FFFFFF;margin:0px auto;border-radius:8px;max-width:700px;">
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background: #FFFFFF;background-color: #FFFFFF;width: 100%;border-radius: 8px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr>
  <td style="direction: ltr;font-size: 0px;padding: 20px 0;padding-bottom: 0px;padding-top: 20px;text-align: center;vertical-align: top;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
    <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 20px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <tr>
                <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                  <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/slack-history">
                    <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Saving-and-searching-Slack-message-with-Airbyte-and-Meilisearch.jpg" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 220px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/slack-history" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>How to save and search through your Slack history with a free plan, using Airbyte and MeiliSearch</b></a>
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">Here's a short tutorial showing how we're leveraging Airbyte and Meilisearch to be able to search through our whole Slack history, even though we're on a free plan. </div>
                  <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/slack-history" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE TUTORIAL&gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color: #EEEEF2;border-top: 1px;">
    <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 40px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <tr>
                <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                  <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/build-a-slack-activity-dashboard">
                    <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Build-a-Slack-activity-dashboard.jpg" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 220px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/build-a-slack-activity-dashboard" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>How to build a Slack Activity dashboard, using Airbyte and Apache Superset</b></a>
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">We're showcasing how we've built a Slack activity dashboard using Airbyte and Apache Superset, so you can do that at home in less than an hour.</div>
                  <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/build-a-slack-activity-dashboard" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE TUTORIAL&gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color: #EEEEF2;border-top: 1px;">
    <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
