                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/adding-incremental-sync" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>How you can add incremental to a source</b></a>
                  </div>
                  <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">This tutorial will show how you can add incremental to your working source, and will build off the "Build a Toy Connector tutorial".  </div>
                  <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/tutorials/adding-incremental-sync" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE TUTORIAL&gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
