              <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color=&quot;#eeeef2&quot;: ;border-top: 1px;">
              
              <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 20px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                        <tr>
                          <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><a href="https://tapestry-pipeline.github.io/case-study">
                            <img src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/605e01bc25f7e19a82e74788/61fa9d0b9e54e1a264ba4da5_61f86b0ae349614926748366_tapestry.jpg" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 200px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                          </td>
                          <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                            <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left: 25px;"><a href="https://tapestry-pipeline.github.io/case-study" style="text-decoration: none;color:#010047;"><b>How Tapestry leverages Airbyte to build end-to-end user data pipelines</b></a></div>
                            <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">Tapestry is building an open-source framework for user data pipelines on top of Airbyte. Learn how they deploy Airbyte on EC2, cache Salesforce API responses and more.</div>
                            <a href="https://tapestry-pipeline.github.io/case-study" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;padding-left: 25px;"><b>Read it here >> </b></span></a>

