          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;">We just released the 1st version of our API docs. You can now use Airflow and Dagster to trigger Airbyte's data syncs. A note though: this API docs will evolve. You won’t lose any functionality, but you may need to update your code </div>
