                        <td style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;"> <a href="https://airbyte.io/community/#contributors?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210120"><img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Newsletter-7-Contributor-wall.png" style="border: 0;display: block;outline: none;text-decoration: none;height: auto;width: 100%;font-size: 13px;border-radius: 8px;box-shadow: 1px 1px 1px 1px #DFDFDF;line-height: 100%;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;" width="520" alt="Newsletter-7-Contributor-wall.png"></a>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="vertical-align: top;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;" width="100%">
            <tr>
              <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/community/#contributors?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210120" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>Our new wall of contributors</b></a>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;">We wanted to thank our contributors for their help in improving Airbyte. They built new connectors (Tempo, App Store, Plaid, etc.), helped us improve and scale some of them (Snowflake), and provide a better developer experience. </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 5px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <a href="https://airbyte.io/community/#contributors?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210120" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;"><b>CHECK OUT THE WALL OF CONTRIBUTORS &gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color: #EEEEF2;border-top: 1px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                    <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/changelog/platform?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210120">
                      <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/New-sources-on-Airbyte_Newsletter-7.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 200px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/changelog/platform?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210120" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>New sources: Plaid, Looker, Tempo, App Store</b></a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">Our focus lately has been about strengthening and expanding incremental support across our connectors (50% done). Thanks to the community, we also have some new sources to announce.</div>
                    <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/changelog/platform?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210120" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE CHANGELOG &gt;&gt; </b></span></a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color: #EEEEF2;border-top: 1px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                    <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/integrations/connector-health?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119">
                      <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Connector-Health_Newsletter-7.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 200px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/integrations/connector-health?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>Our connectors' health status</b></a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">You can now see the health status for all our connectors. Our focus for this quarter will be to strengthen our connectors to become production-ready.</div>
                    <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/integrations/connector-health?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE CONNECTORS' HEALTH STATUS</b></span></a>
                    
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      
      <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color: #EEEEF2;border-top: 1px;">
      <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                    <a href="https://airbyte.io/articles/our-story/our-okrs-for-q1-2021/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119">
                      <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/OKRs-1.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 220px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/articles/our-story/our-okrs-for-q1-2021/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>Our OKRs for Q1 2021!</b></a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">We've had diverse experiences with OKRs. In this article, we'd like to share our learnings, as well as Airbyte’s OKRs for Q1 2021. It's a good way to see where our focus is too. </div>
                    <a href="https://airbyte.io/articles/our-story/our-okrs-for-q1-2021/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK OUR OKRS</b></span></a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
