                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/articles/our-story/how-we-chose-our-logo-and-mascot/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>How We Chose Our Logo and Mascot</b></a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">We’re sharing all the iterations that went into the creation of our logo and mascot, and what our thoughts were for each one of them.</div>
                    <a href="https://airbyte.io/articles/our-story/how-we-chose-our-logo-and-mascot/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-07-20210119" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK OUT THE LOGO and MASCOT ITERATIONS&gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
                  </td>
