<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
<tr>
<td style="padding: 40px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;"><a href="https://medium.com/geekculture/the-1-reason-snowflake-is-different-dce334b586d1">
        <img src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/605e01bc25f7e19a82e74788/60d121f04c793f9e99026e39_What%20is%20the%20Open%20Data%20Ecosystem%20and%20Why%20it%E2%80%99s%20Here%20To%20Stay.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 220px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
        <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://medium.com/geekculture/the-1-reason-snowflake-is-different-dce334b586d1" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>The #1 reason Snowflake is different</b></a>
      </div>
      <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">Here's an analysis on the evolution of data warehouses and of Snowflake, in order to explain the major technical advantage they have over others</div>
