                        <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">Madison Schott shares five best practices to design a data ingestion pipeline. It covers documenting your sources, keeping a copy of raw data at all times, orchestration, testing and alerting at the data source.</div>
