                        <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">All data professionals have spent countless hours working on data movement, we want to hear your stories, what has worked, what hasn’t worked, what has made your job easier. All topics are on the table!  </div>
                        <a href="https://sessionize.com/movedata-2022/" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;padding-left: 25px;"><b>Submit here >> </b></span></a>

