                          </td>
                          <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0pt;mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                            <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left: 25px;"><a href="https://planetscale.com/blog/extract-load-and-transform-your-data-with-planetscale-connect" style="text-decoration: none;color:#010047;"><b>Extract, load, and transform your PlanetScale data with Airbyte</b></a></div>
                            <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left: 25px;padding-bottom: 5px;">PlanetScale is a MySQL-compatible serverless database. To give their users the possibility to move their applications data to a data warehouse, they built an Airbyte connector instead of a new ELT product.</div>
                            <a href="https://planetscale.com/blog/extract-load-and-transform-your-data-with-planetscale-connect" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;padding-left: 25px;"><b>Read it here >> </b></span></a>

                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>
                             </td>
              </tr>
        	</tbody>
            </table>
          </div>     
      
