                      </div>
                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">A great article by our friends at Preset comparing Airbyte to Meltano. In the end, the Preset team ended up using Airbyte for its ease of use, containerized architecture, and velocity.</div>
                      <a href="https://preset.io/blog/2021-4-22-data-integration-tooling/" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE ARTICLE &gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
