        <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                  <tr>
                    <td valign="middle" width="30%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                      <a href="https://larskamp.medium.com/why-we-sold-intermix-io-to-private-equity-in-a-shifting-market-5bdb3e4e30a4">
                        <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Why-we-sold-intermix-to-private-equity-in-a-shifting-market.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 220px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                      </td>
                      <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                        <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://larskamp.medium.com/why-we-sold-intermix-io-to-private-equity-in-a-shifting-market-5bdb3e4e30a4" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>Why we sold intermix.io to private equity in a shifting market</b></a>
                      </div>
                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">This very interesting article relates the history of Intermix.io, but also of Snowflake and the reasons for its growth. An awesome read with a lot of gold nuggets on the forces that drives the data infrastructure industry. </div>
                      <a href="https://larskamp.medium.com/why-we-sold-intermix-io-to-private-equity-in-a-shifting-market-5bdb3e4e30a4" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE ARTICLE &gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>
        <hr class="EEEEF2" style="color: #EEEEF2;border-top: 1px;">
        <div style="font-size:13px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px 40px 40px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
