                      <a href="https://betterprogramming.pub/what-skills-does-a-data-engineer-need-55ea69f77422">
                        <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/What-Skills-Does-a-Data-Engineer-Need.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 220px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
