                        <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://betterprogramming.pub/what-skills-does-a-data-engineer-need-55ea69f77422" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>What Skills Does a Data Engineer Need?</b></a>
                      </div>
                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">A great article by <a href="https://twitter.com/SeattleDataGuy">@SeattleDataGuy</a> on the skills needed by data engineers. From Python/SQL as foundational skills, to ETL/ELT, data viz, distributed processing, and more!</div>
                      <a href="https://betterprogramming.pub/what-skills-does-a-data-engineer-need-55ea69f77422" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE ARTICLE &gt;&gt;</b></span></a>
