                  </div>
                  <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">New destination: MSSQL (a little birdie told us S3 is coming soon!). New sources: Clickhouse, Klaviyo, Asana, Tempo, Recharge... Also, a LOT of new connectors are being built by the community with the CDK. This is so exciting!</div>
                  <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/project-overview/changelog/connectors" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE CHANGELOG &gt;&gt; </b></span></a>
