                <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">A few weeks ago, we released Change Data Capture (log replication) for Postgres. This will be soon available for MySQL, MSSQL, and other DBs soon. Here's a 4-min video showing how it works. </div>
