                <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/sources?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-03%20-20201104" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>9 new sources: Salesforce, Facebook, GAs, Hubspot &amp; more</b></a>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;">Nine new source connectors are coming this week! And we're just getting started. We should have new ones every day from now on. </div>
