                      <img src="https://airbyte.io/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Snowflake_new-integration.png" alt="" style="width: 100%;max-width: 200px;height: auto;margin: auto;display: block;border-radius: 8px;vertical-align: top;box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px 0px #DFDFDF;border: 0;line-height: 100%;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;"></a>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="middle" width="70%" style="border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/integrations/destinations/snowflake?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-03%20-20201104" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>New destination: Snowflake!</b></a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">Snowflake was our most requested destination. We now have BigQuery, Postgres, CSV, and Snowflake. Redshift is coming next. </div>
                    <a href="https://docs.airbyte.io/integrations/destinations/snowflake?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-03%20-20201104" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#625EFF;letter-spacing:1px;padding-left: 25px;"><b>CHECK THE SNOWFLAKE DOC &gt;&gt; </b></span></a>
