                      <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;color:#010047;text-decoration:none;padding-left:25px;"><a href="https://airbyte.io/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter-03%20-20201104" style="text-decoration:none;color:#010047;"><b>Our new logo!</b></a>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">What is it? It's a bit abstract so it can symbolize several things! An octopus, a comet, a byte that flies fast. We're now working on an octopus mascot. Stay tuned!</div>
                    
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
