                    </div>
                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">Or how we are building a manufacturing plant of connectors, so we can build and maintain a large catalog of connectors. It's all about thinking in onion layers. </div>
