          <tr>
            <td style="font-size: 0px;padding: 0px 40px 0px 40px;border-collapse: collapse;mso-table-lspace: 0;mso-table-rspace: 0;">
              <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;">We had the choice to launch early with a soft launch, or later with more press. This article relates why we chose the former.</div>
            </td>
