                    <div style="font-family:Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;padding-left:25px;padding-bottom:5px;">By being cloud-based and closed source, current solutions are limited and limiting. In this article, we explain the vision behind our open-source approach. </div>
