                      <div style="font-family:Inter, Helvetica, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#010047;">A lot of companies wants to pay to get their custom connectors built, and we know lots of consulting agencies and contractors that wants to help. So we built a Connector Marketplace! A note: if you contribute a new connector to the open-source repo, we'll give you $500 worth of Airbyte Cloud credits!</div>
